==English==

===Etymology===
{{rfe|en}}
From {{uder|en|nl|Nieuw-Zeeland||new Zeeland}} ({{m|nl|nieuw}} calqued as {{m|en|new}}), after the Dutch settlement in [[Batavia]], which in turn had been named after the Dutch province of [[Zeeland]].

